Description: Advanced Normalization Tools for medical image registration
 Advanced Normalization Tools (ANTs) computes high-dimensional mappings to
 capture the statistics of brain structure and function. It is a widely used
 toolkit for medical image registration, segmentation and template
 construction, built on the Insight Toolkit (ITK).
 .
 This package provides the ANTs command-line programs (antsRegistration,
 antsApplyTransforms, N4BiasFieldCorrection, Atropos, ...), the helper
 scripts, and the internal shared libraries they require.
